#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`ds18x20` --- DS18x20 temperature sensor driver"
msgstr ":mod:`ds18x20` --- upravljački program za DS18x20 senzor temperature"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`ds18x20` module provides a driver for the Maxim/Dallas DS18B20, "
"DS18S20 and DS1822 1-Wire digital temperature sensors. It is built on top of"
" the :mod:`onewire` module and supports multiple sensors sharing a single "
"bus."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`ds18x20` pruža upravljački program za Maxim/Dallas DS18B20, "
"DS18S20 i DS1822 1-Wire digitalne senzore temperature. Izgrađen je na vrhu "
"modula :mod:`onewire` i podržava više senzora koji dijele jednu sabirnicu."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:11
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:27
msgid "Classes"
msgstr ""
"Konstruira DS18x20 upravljački program vezan na danu `onewire.OneWire` "
"sabirnicu. Više DS18x20 senzora može dijeliti istu sabirnicu."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:31
msgid ""
"Construct a DS18x20 driver bound to the given `onewire.OneWire` bus. "
"Multiple DS18x20 sensors may share the same bus."
msgstr ""
"Konstruira DS18x20 upravljač vezan za zadanu `onewire.OneWire` sabirnicu. "
"Više DS18x20 senzora može dijeliti istu sabirnicu."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:36
msgid ""
"Search the underlying 1-Wire bus and return a list of ROM codes that "
"correspond to DS18x20-family devices. Only ROMs whose family code is "
"``0x10`` (DS18S20), ``0x22`` (DS1822) or ``0x28`` (DS18B20) are returned; "
"other 1-Wire devices on the same bus are filtered out."
msgstr ""
"Pretražuje temeljnu 1-Wire sabirnicu i vraća listu ROM kodova koji "
"odgovaraju uređajima iz obitelji DS18x20. Vraćaju se samo ROM-ovi čiji je "
"kod obitelji ``0x10`` (DS18S20), ``0x22`` (DS1822) ili ``0x28`` (DS18B20); "
"ostali 1-Wire uređaji na istoj sabirnici se filtriraju."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:43
msgid ""
"Issue a temperature conversion command to **all** DS18x20 sensors on the bus"
" simultaneously (using SKIP ROM). After calling this method you must wait "
"for the conversion to complete (up to 750 ms at the default 12-bit "
"resolution) before calling :meth:`read_temp`."
msgstr ""
"Izdaje naredbu za pretvorbu temperature **svim** DS18x20 senzorima na "
"sabirnici istovremeno (koristeći SKIP ROM). Nakon poziva ove metode morate "
"pričekati da se pretvorba dovrši (do 750 ms pri zadanoj 12-bitnoj "
"razlučivosti) prije poziva :meth:`read_temp`\\ ."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:50
msgid ""
"Read the 9-byte scratchpad from the device addressed by *rom* and return it "
"as a ``bytearray``. The scratchpad CRC is verified; raises :exc:`Exception` "
"with the message ``\"CRC error\"`` on a CRC mismatch."
msgstr ""
"Čita 9-bajtni scratchpad s uređaja adresiranog s *rom* i vraća ga kao "
"``bytearray``\\ . CRC scratchpada se provjerava; pokreće :exc:`Exception` s "
"porukom ``\"CRC error\"`` pri neslaganju CRC-a."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:57
msgid ""
"The returned buffer is the driver's internal buffer and is overwritten by "
"subsequent calls."
msgstr ""
"Vraćeni međuspremnik je interni međuspremnik upravljačkog programa i "
"prepisuje se naknadnim pozivima."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:62
msgid ""
"Write 3 bytes to the scratchpad of the device addressed by *rom*. *buf* must"
" contain the high alarm trigger (TH), low alarm trigger (TL) and "
"configuration register values."
msgstr ""
"Zapisuje 3 bajta u scratchpad uređaja adresiranog s *rom*\\ . *buf* mora "
"sadržavati vrijednosti okidača visokog alarma (TH), okidača niskog alarma "
"(TL) i konfiguracijskog registra."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:68
msgid ""
"Read the most recently converted temperature from the device addressed by "
"*rom* and return it in degrees Celsius as a ``float``. Handles both DS18S20 "
"(family code ``0x10``) and DS18B20 / DS1822 (family codes ``0x28`` / "
"``0x22``) encodings, including negative temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Čita najnoviju pretvorenu temperaturu s uređaja adresiranog s *rom* i vraća "
"je u stupnjevima Celzija kao ``float``\\ . Obrađuje kodiranja i DS18S20 (kod"
" obitelji ``0x10``\\ ) i DS18B20 / DS1822 (kodovi obitelji ``0x28`` / "
"``0x22``\\ ), uključujući negativne temperature."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:74
msgid ""
"Call :meth:`convert_temp` and wait for the conversion to finish before "
"calling this method."
msgstr ""
"Pozovite :meth:`convert_temp` i pričekajte da pretvorba završi prije poziva "
"ove metode."
